---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import connect from '../../assets/pathways/connect.jpg';
---
<Base title="Connect"><div class="station-page">
<section class="station-hero station-hero-split"><div class="station-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">CONNECT / SCIENCE IS A TEAM SPORT</p><h1>Find your <em>people.</em></h1><p class="lead">A great observation might start with one person. The most interesting discoveries often begin when people share questions, methods, evidence, and credit.</p><a class="station-button" href="#community">Find a way in ↓</a></div><Image src={connect} alt="Naturalists studying fungi together in the woods" widths={[500,850]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw,48vw"/></section>
<section class="station-content" id="community"><div class="station-section-head"><h2>MAKE A CONNECTION</h2><span>PEOPLE / PROJECTS / CONTRIBUTIONS</span></div><div class="station-editorial-grid">
<a class="station-editorial-card" href="/#neomyco"><span class="station-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="station-card-body"><small>REGIONAL SCIENCE</small><strong>NEO MYCO</strong><span>Citizen science, fieldwork, and collaboration in Northeast Ohio.</span><b>Explore NEO MYCO →</b></span></a>
<a class="station-editorial-card" href="/investigate/learn/#surveys"><span class="station-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><span class="station-card-body"><small>JOIN THE WORK</small><strong>Community field surveys</strong><span>See how observations and repeat visits can become useful biodiversity records.</span><b>Explore projects →</b></span></a>
<a class="station-editorial-card" href="/investigate/learn/"><span class="station-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="station-card-body"><small>PEOPLE DOING THE WORK</small><strong>Find your role in mycology</strong><span>Discover research disciplines and ways to contribute at any experience level.</span><b>Find an entry point →</b></span></a>
</div></section></div></Base>